## Notes

* `budgets` is always a list, empty when the organization has no budgets configured, so configurations can iterate over it unconditionally.
* `consumption`, `percentage` and `threshold_exceeded` reflect real spend and can change between reads with no configuration change.
* The organization-level budget is the entry with `project_id == null`; every other entry is a per-project budget.
